@startuml C1_Search_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C1 – Search Operation Plans (Context View)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth2/OIDC)" as IAM
rectangle "Frontoffice SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "Operation Plans UI" as UI
}
rectangle "TodoApi" as Gateway
cloud "OEM Planning Service" as OEM

database "OEM Plans Store" as Db

Operator --> UI : Browser (HTTPS)
UI --> Gateway : REST request (filters)
Gateway --> IAM : Validate session
Gateway --> OEM : GET /operation-plans
OEM --> Db : Query filtered plans
Db --> OEM : Result set
OEM --> Gateway : Plan list JSON
Gateway --> UI : Forward response

@enduml
